  "prompt": "【图片裁剪框（固定比例）Fixed-Ratio Image Crop】目标：用于裁头像 / 封面 / 竖版图——**裁剪框比例锁定**（1:1 / 16:9 / 4:5 切换），只能移动或等比缩放，拖任意角/边都不改变比例；**实时预览小窗必须放在图片区域之外**（卡片在图片下方工具行、弹窗在图片右侧一列），绝不遮挡画面；框外压暗、框内三分线、框上显示输出尺寸。\n\n1) 结构：body flex 列、居中、padding 4。.card（宽 min(320px,100%)、圆角 13、padding 7 9、底色 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg))、描边 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent)、纵向 flex gap 4）里面只有两块：\n① .stage（position:relative、height 104、圆角 8、overflow:hidden、touch-action:none）——图片区，**内部只放 .photo 和 .crop，不放任何预览浮层**；\n② .side（图片区之外的工具栏，flex、align-items:center、gap 5、height 40）——从左到右：.pvSlot（36×36 槽，`display:grid;place-items:center`）→ .info（输出尺寸文字）→ .ratioRow（锁图标 + 三个比例按钮）→ .foot（取消/应用，`margin-left:auto`）。\n\n2) 图片与裁剪框：.photo 用纯 CSS 画照片（两团 radial-gradient 光斑 + `linear-gradient(160deg,...)`，`::after` 用 `clip-path:polygon(...)` 画山形剪影，不引用外部图片）。.crop（absolute、left/top/width/height 由 JS 写、1.5px 底色描边、圆角 2、cursor:move、`box-shadow:0 0 0 2000px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 55%,transparent)` 压暗框外、`::after` 叠两层 1px 渐变线 + `background-size:33.333% 33.333%` 画三分线）。.size（absolute、`left:50%;top:2px`、translateX(-50%)、半透明底、7.5px、tabular-nums）——**放在框内侧顶部**，不要放框外（贴边时会被 stage 的 overflow 裁掉一半）。\n\n3) **预览（核心）**：`.preview` 放在 `.pvSlot` 里（与 stage 完全不同的 DOM 子树，自然不重叠），`position:relative`、`overflow:hidden`、1.5px 底色描边 + 阴影、`pointer-events:none`；内部 `.pvInner`（absolute、left 0 top 0、`transform-origin:0 0`，里面再放一份 `.photo`）+ 底部 `.pvTag`（当前比例文字，5.5px）。每次 `paint()` 调 `paintPreview()`：\n- 读槽位尺寸 `sw/sh`，读预览边框宽 `bwX/bwY`（`getComputedStyle`）；\n- `k = Math.min((sw-bwX)/box.w, (sh-bwY)/box.h)`（按比例 contain 进槽位，任何比例都不会溢出）；\n- `preview.style.width = box.w*k + bwX`、`height = box.h*k + bwY`；\n- `pvInner` 尺寸设为 stage 尺寸，`transform: translate(-box.x*k, -box.y*k) scale(k)` → 裁剪框内那块照片正好铺满预览窗。\n**必须扣边框宽**，否则小窗内容区差 2–3px、预览比例肉眼可见地歪。\n\n4) 比例锁定：`ratio = w/h`（1:1 = 1、16:9 = 1.7778、4:5 = 0.8）。所有缩放只算宽度、`h = w/ratio`。统一函数 `boxFromWidth(anchorX, anchorY, w, anchor)`：先把 `w` 夹到 `[MIN_W, min(stageW, stageH*ratio)]`，`h = w/ratio`，按锚点算 x/y（br 锚点=框左上角、tl 锚点=框右下角、tr=左下、bl=右上；left 锚点=右边、top 锚点=底边，交叉方向按中心对齐），最后把 x/y 夹进 stage。8 个手柄的调用：\n- br：`boxFromWidth(b.x, b.y, b.w+dx, 'br')`；tl：`boxFromWidth(b.x+b.w, b.y+b.h, b.w-dx, 'tl')`；tr：`boxFromWidth(b.x, b.y+b.h, b.w+dx, 'tr')`；bl：`boxFromWidth(b.x+b.w, b.y, b.w-dx, 'bl')`\n- right：`boxFromWidth(b.x, b.y+(b.h-(b.w+dx)/ratio)/2, b.w+dx, 'right')`；left：`boxFromWidth(b.x+b.w, b.y+(b.h-(b.w-dx)/ratio)/2, b.w-dx, 'left')`\n- bottom：`boxFromWidth(b.x+(b.w-(b.h+dy)*ratio)/2, b.y, (b.h+dy)*ratio, 'bottom')`；top：`boxFromWidth(b.x+(b.w-(b.h-dy)*ratio)/2, b.y+b.h, (b.h-dy)*ratio, 'top')`\n拖框内部只改 x/y，尺寸不变。初始/切比例：`w = Math.min(stageW*0.62, stageH*0.82*ratio)`、居中。\n\n5) 8 个手柄：4 角 `.handle.corner`（10×10，外挂 -5px）+ 4 边 `.handle.edge`（上/下 14×6、左/右 6×14），`box-shadow:0 0 0 1.5px var(--ui-brand)`，按下 stopPropagation，pointer 事件 + `setPointerCapture` + `preventDefault`。\n\n6) 首帧守卫：`reset(tries)` 里若 stage 宽高为 0（iframe 首帧），rAF 重试最多 60 帧再算居中框。\n\n7) 无障碍与配色：比例按钮原生 button + data-ratio；手柄 button + aria-label；应用时给框 1 秒 success 描边 + 3px 光环；取消 = 重置居中框。变量：--ui-bg 画布/手柄底/尺寸标签字、--ui-surface 卡片、--ui-surface-2 次级表面、--ui-border 分隔线、--ui-text 正文/遮罩混合、--ui-text-dim 比例按钮与说明、--ui-brand 手柄描边/选中按钮、--ui-success 应用态与照片渐变、--ui-warn 照片光斑。\n\n8) 坑：①**预览不能浮在图片上**（用户反馈过：小窗挡住要裁的画面）——必须放在 .stage 之外的工具栏/侧栏，DOM 上就不在同一容器；②预览尺寸要按槽位 contain 并扣边框宽，否则比例歪；③br 手柄锚点必须是当前框左上角快照 `(b.x, b.y)`，写成 `(0,0)` 会把框瞬间拽到图片左上角；④框上尺寸标签放框内侧顶部，避免贴边被裁；⑤卡片 367×176 空间紧：图片 104 + 工具行 40 + 卡片内边距，工具行里字要小（7–8px）、按钮 16–18px 高；⑥`MIN_W` 要大于手柄直径；⑦切换比例会重新居中（真实产品可保留中心点）。\n\n9) 弹窗初始态（740×733，交互模式）：1:1 选中、框居中、**右侧列显示 164px 的预览窗**（内容与框内一致）、下方比例按钮与底部取消/应用，即目标态。\n\n10) 弹窗布局（高度 ≥421）：`.card` 改 `flex-direction:row; align-items:stretch; width:min(480px,100%)`；`.stage{flex:1; height:520px}`；`.side{width:164px; flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; gap:12px; height:auto}`，其中 .pvSlot 164×164（浅底 + 描边 + 圆角 12）、.info 12.5px、比例按钮 30 高 / 13px、按钮 36 高 / 14px 且 `.foot{margin-top:auto}` 贴底。卡片档（高度 ≤420）：图片 104（小视口 102）、工具行 38–40，预览槽 34–36，比例按钮 16 高 / 7.5px，按钮 18 高 / 8px，`.info` 7px 且 `.infoLock` 隐藏。\n\n11) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环；首轮延迟 0.3 秒；一轮 = 1:1 居中 → 500ms 点「16:9」→ 500ms 拖框 (+14,+6) → 300ms 拖右下角等比放大 (+30,+18) → 400ms 点应用 → 500ms 后 cursor.hide()、1.3 秒后回 1:1 复位；间隔 8.2 秒。\n\n12) 使用场景：见 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:4px}\n\n.card{width:min(320px,100%);margin:0 auto;background:var(--ui-surface);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg));border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent);border-radius:13px;padding:7px 9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;flex:0 0 auto}\n\n/* 图片区：没有预览浮层，画面不被遮挡 */\n.stage{position:relative;height:104px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,var(--ui-bg));touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\n.photo{position:absolute;inset:0;background:\n  radial-gradient(circle at 26% 30%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-warn) 55%,transparent),transparent 55%),\n  radial-gradient(circle at 74% 22%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 35%,transparent),transparent 50%),\n  linear-gradient(160deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 22%,var(--ui-bg)),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-success) 40%,var(--ui-bg)) 68%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 45%,var(--ui-bg)))}\n.photo::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:46%;background:linear-gradient(to top,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 55%,transparent),transparent);clip-path:polygon(0 62%,18% 34%,34% 58%,52% 22%,70% 52%,86% 30%,100% 58%,100% 100%,0 100%)}\n\n.crop{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:0;height:0;box-shadow:0 0 0 2000px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 55%,transparent),0 0 0 1.5px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 92%,transparent) inset;border:1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 96%,transparent);border-radius:2px;cursor:move;touch-action:none;transition:box-shadow .2s ease,border-color .2s ease}\n.crop::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;\n  background-image:linear-gradient(to right,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 42%,transparent) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(to bottom,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 42%,transparent) 1px,transparent 1px);\n  background-size:33.333% 33.333%;opacity:.65}\n.crop.dragging{border-color:var(--ui-brand);box-shadow:0 0 0 2000px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 55%,transparent),0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 40%,transparent)}\n\n.size{position:absolute;left:50%;top:2px;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:0 4px;border-radius:3px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 82%,transparent);color:var(--ui-bg);font-size:7.5px;line-height:11px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;pointer-events:none;z-index:2}\n\n.handle{position:absolute;padding:0;border:0;background:var(--ui-bg);border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 0 0 1.5px var(--ui-brand);touch-action:none}\n.handle.corner{width:10px;height:10px}\n.handle.br{right:-5px;bottom:-5px;cursor:nwse-resize}\n.handle.tl{left:-5px;top:-5px;cursor:nwse-resize}\n.handle.tr{right:-5px;top:-5px;cursor:nesw-resize}\n.handle.bl{left:-5px;bottom:-5px;cursor:nesw-resize}\n.handle.edge{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 92%,var(--ui-brand))}\n.handle.top{left:50%;top:-5px;width:14px;height:6px;margin-left:-7px;cursor:ns-resize}\n.handle.bottom{left:50%;bottom:-5px;width:14px;height:6px;margin-left:-7px;cursor:ns-resize}\n.handle.left{top:50%;left:-5px;width:6px;height:14px;margin-top:-7px;cursor:ew-resize}\n.handle.right{top:50%;right:-5px;width:6px;height:14px;margin-top:-7px;cursor:ew-resize}\n.handle:focus-visible{outline:2px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 60%,transparent);outline-offset:2px}\n\n/* 图片下方工具行（预览 + 尺寸 + 比例 + 按钮），与图片区完全不重叠 */\n.side{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:40px;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:0}\n.pvSlot{width:36px;height:36px;flex:0 0 auto;display:grid;place-items:center}\n.preview{position:relative;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;border:1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 92%,transparent);box-shadow:0 1px 4px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 30%,transparent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,var(--ui-bg));pointer-events:none}\n.preview .pvInner{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;transform-origin:0 0}\n.preview .pvTag{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:0 2px;font-size:5.5px;line-height:8px;color:var(--ui-bg);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 70%,transparent);text-align:center;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.info{font-size:7px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;flex:0 0 auto;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.info b{color:var(--ui-text);font-weight:600}\n.info .infoLock{display:none}\n\n.ratioRow{display:flex;gap:2px;flex:0 0 auto;align-items:center}\n.ratio-btn{flex:0 0 auto;height:16px;padding:0 5px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 14%,transparent);border-radius:4px;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:7.5px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;outline:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;transition:background .12s ease,color .12s ease,border-color .12s ease,transform .1s ease}\n.ratio-btn:hover{color:var(--ui-text);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 26%,transparent)}\n.ratio-btn.pressing{transform:scale(.94)}\n.ratio-btn.on{background:var(--ui-brand);border-color:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg)}\n.ratio-btn:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 35%,transparent)}\n.ratioRow .lock{width:7px;height:7px;flex:0 0 auto;fill:none;stroke:var(--ui-text-dim);stroke-width:2.2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.ratioRow .hintTxt{display:none}\n\n.foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-left:auto;flex:0 0 auto}\n.btn{height:18px;padding:0 7px;border-radius:4px;font:inherit;font-size:8px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .1s ease,background .12s ease,opacity .15s ease}\n.btn.pressing{transform:scale(.95)}\n.btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 16%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.btn.ghost:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 6%,var(--ui-bg));color:var(--ui-text)}\n.btn.ok{background:var(--ui-brand);border:0;color:var(--ui-bg)}\n.btn.ok:hover{opacity:.92}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:3px}\n  .card{padding:6px 8px;gap:4px}\n  .stage{height:102px}\n  .side{height:38px}\n  .pvSlot{width:34px;height:34px}\n}\n\n/* 放大弹窗（740×733）：图片区占主区 + 右侧一列（预览 + 比例 + 按钮） */\n@media (min-height:421px){\n  body{padding:40px}\n  .card{width:min(480px,100%);flex-direction:row;align-items:stretch;padding:18px 20px;gap:16px;border-radius:18px}\n  .stage{flex:1;height:520px;border-radius:14px}\n  .crop{border-width:2px}\n  .size{font-size:13px;line-height:20px;padding:0 8px;top:3px;border-radius:6px}\n  .handle.corner{width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:4px}\n  .handle.br{right:-9px;bottom:-9px}\n  .handle.tl{left:-9px;top:-9px}\n  .handle.tr{right:-9px;top:-9px}\n  .handle.bl{left:-9px;bottom:-9px}\n  .handle::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-12px}\n  .handle.top{top:-8px;width:26px;height:10px;margin-left:-13px}\n  .handle.bottom{bottom:-8px;width:26px;height:10px;margin-left:-13px}\n  .handle.left{left:-8px;width:10px;height:26px;margin-top:-13px}\n  .handle.right{right:-8px;width:10px;height:26px;margin-top:-13px}\n\n  .side{width:164px;flex:0 0 auto;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:12px;height:auto}\n  .pvSlot{width:164px;height:164px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:12px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg));border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent)}\n  .preview{border-radius:6px;border-width:2px}\n  .preview .pvTag{font-size:10px;line-height:16px;padding:0 6px}\n  .info{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;white-space:normal}\n  .info .infoLock{display:inline}\n  .ratioRow{gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .ratio-btn{height:30px;padding:0 10px;font-size:13px;border-radius:7px;border-width:1.5px;gap:5px}\n  .ratioRow .lock{width:13px;height:13px}\n  .foot{flex-direction:row;margin-left:0;gap:8px;margin-top:auto}\n  .btn{height:36px;padding:0 14px;font-size:14px;flex:1;border-radius:8px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .crop,.btn,.ratio-btn{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"card\" id=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\">\n    <div class=\"photo\"></div>\n    <div class=\"crop\" id=\"crop\">\n      <span class=\"size\" id=\"size\">320 × 320</span>\n      <button class=\"handle corner tl\" type=\"button\" data-h=\"tl\" aria-label=\"左上角等比缩放\"></button>\n      <button class=\"handle edge top\" type=\"button\" data-h=\"t\" aria-label=\"上边等比缩放\"></button>\n      <button class=\"handle corner tr\" type=\"button\" data-h=\"tr\" aria-label=\"右上角等比缩放\"></button>\n      <button class=\"handle edge left\" type=\"button\" data-h=\"l\" aria-label=\"左边等比缩放\"></button>\n      <button class=\"handle edge right\" type=\"button\" data-h=\"r\" aria-label=\"右边等比缩放\"></button>\n      <button class=\"handle corner bl\" type=\"button\" data-h=\"bl\" aria-label=\"左下角等比缩放\"></button>\n      <button class=\"handle edge bottom\" type=\"button\" data-h=\"b\" aria-label=\"下边等比缩放\"></button>\n      <button class=\"handle corner br\" type=\"button\" data-h=\"br\" aria-label=\"右下角等比缩放\"></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"side\" id=\"side\">\n    <div class=\"pvSlot\">\n      <div class=\"preview\" id=\"preview\">\n        <div class=\"pvInner\" id=\"pvInner\"><div class=\"photo\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"pvTag\" id=\"pvTag\">1:1</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"info\">输出 <b id=\"sizeText\">320 × 320</b><span class=\"infoLock\"> · 比例锁定</span></span>\n    <div class=\"ratioRow\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"裁剪比例\">\n      <svg class=\"lock\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"10.5\" width=\"14\" height=\"9.5\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8.2 10.5V8a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 7.6 0v2.5\"/></svg>\n      <button class=\"ratio-btn on\" type=\"button\" data-ratio=\"1\">1:1</button>\n      <button class=\"ratio-btn\" type=\"button\" data-ratio=\"1.7778\">16:9</button>\n      <button class=\"ratio-btn\" type=\"button\" data-ratio=\"0.8\">4:5</button>\n      <span class=\"hintTxt\" id=\"ratioHint\">比例锁定</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\">\n      <button class=\"btn ghost\" id=\"cancel\" type=\"button\">取消</button>\n      <button class=\"btn ok\" id=\"apply\" type=\"button\">应用</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var stage = document.getElementById('stage'),\n      crop = document.getElementById('crop'),\n      sizeEl = document.getElementById('size'),\n      sizeText = document.getElementById('sizeText'),\n      preview = document.getElementById('preview'),\n      pvInner = document.getElementById('pvInner'),\n      pvTag = document.getElementById('pvTag'),\n      ratioHint = document.getElementById('ratioHint'),\n      ratioBtns = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.ratio-btn')),\n      cancelBtn = document.getElementById('cancel'),\n      applyBtn = document.getElementById('apply');\n\n  var SCALE = 2;\n  var MIN_W = 26;                 /* 最小裁剪宽度（stage 像素） */\n  var ratio = 1;                  /* w / h，锁定 */\n  var ratioLabel = '1:1';\n  var box = { x: 0, y: 0, w: 0, h: 0 };\n  var mode = null;\n  var dragStart = null;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null, rafId = 0;\n\n  function stageSize(){ return { w: stage.clientWidth, h: stage.clientHeight }; }\n  function clamp(v, lo, hi){ return Math.max(lo, Math.min(hi, v)); }\n\n  function paint(){\n    crop.style.left = box.x + 'px';\n    crop.style.top = box.y + 'px';\n    crop.style.width = box.w + 'px';\n    crop.style.height = box.h + 'px';\n    var label = Math.round(box.w * SCALE) + ' × ' + Math.round(box.h * SCALE);\n    sizeEl.textContent = label;\n    sizeText.textContent = label;\n    paintPreview();\n  }\n\n  /* 预览：把与 stage 等大的照片层按 k 缩放平移，让裁剪框内那块内容正好铺满预览窗。\n     预览窗放在图片区外（卡片=下方工具行 / 弹窗=右侧列），按比例 contain 进槽位。 */\n  function paintPreview(){\n    var slot = preview.parentNode;\n    var sw = slot.clientWidth, sh = slot.clientHeight;\n    if(!sw || !sh || !box.w || !box.h) return;\n    var cs = getComputedStyle(preview);\n    var bwX = parseFloat(cs.borderLeftWidth) + parseFloat(cs.borderRightWidth);\n    var bwY = parseFloat(cs.borderTopWidth) + parseFloat(cs.borderBottomWidth);\n    var k = Math.min((sw - bwX) / box.w, (sh - bwY) / box.h);\n    preview.style.width = (box.w * k + bwX) + 'px';\n    preview.style.height = (box.h * k + bwY) + 'px';\n    pvTag.textContent = ratioLabel;\n    var s = stageSize();\n    pvInner.style.width = s.w + 'px';\n    pvInner.style.height = s.h + 'px';\n    pvInner.style.transform = 'translate(' + (-box.x * k) + 'px,' + (-box.y * k) + 'px) scale(' + k + ')';\n  }\n\n  /* 用锚点 + 宽度推导 box（宽度先夹到合法范围），保持比例 */\n  function boxFromWidth(anchorX, anchorY, w, anchor){\n    w = clamp(w, MIN_W, Math.min(stageSize().w, stageSize().h * ratio));\n    var h = w / ratio;\n    var x = anchorX, y = anchorY;\n    if(anchor === 'tl'){ x = anchorX - w; y = anchorY - h; }\n    else if(anchor === 'tr'){ x = anchorX; y = anchorY - h; }\n    else if(anchor === 'bl'){ x = anchorX - w; y = anchorY; }\n    else if(anchor === 'left'){ x = anchorX - w; y = anchorY; }\n    else if(anchor === 'top'){ x = anchorX; y = anchorY - h; }\n    /* right / bottom / br：锚点在左上 */\n    var s = stageSize();\n    x = clamp(x, 0, s.w - w);\n    y = clamp(y, 0, s.h - h);\n    box = { x: x, y: y, w: w, h: h };\n  }\n\n  function centerBoxForRatio(){\n    var s = stageSize();\n    var w = Math.min(s.w * 0.62, s.h * 0.82 * ratio);\n    w = Math.max(w, MIN_W);\n    var h = w / ratio;\n    box = {\n      x: Math.round((s.w - w) / 2),\n      y: Math.round((s.h - h) / 2),\n      w: Math.round(w),\n      h: Math.round(h)\n    };\n    paint();\n  }\n\n  function reset(tries){\n    tries = tries || 0;\n    var s = stageSize();\n    if((!s.w || !s.h) && tries < 60){\n      requestAnimationFrame(function(){ reset(tries + 1); });\n      return;\n    }\n    centerBoxForRatio();\n  }\n\n  function setRatio(r, label){\n    ratio = r;\n    ratioLabel = label;\n    ratioBtns.forEach(function(b){\n      b.classList.toggle('on', parseFloat(b.getAttribute('data-ratio')) === r);\n    });\n    ratioHint.textContent = '比例锁定 · ' + label;\n    centerBoxForRatio();\n  }\n\n  function beginDrag(ev, m){\n    if(!ev) return;\n    mode = m;\n    dragStart = { px: ev.clientX, py: ev.clientY, box: { x: box.x, y: box.y, w: box.w, h: box.h } };\n    crop.classList.add('dragging');\n    try { crop.setPointerCapture(ev.pointerId); } catch(e){ /* 忽略 */ }\n    ev.preventDefault();\n  }\n\n  function moveDrag(clientX, clientY){\n    if(!mode || !dragStart) return;\n    var s = stageSize();\n    var dx = clientX - dragStart.px, dy = clientY - dragStart.py;\n    var b = dragStart.box;\n    if(mode === 'move'){\n      box.x = clamp(b.x + dx, 0, s.w - b.w);\n      box.y = clamp(b.y + dy, 0, s.h - b.h);\n      paint();\n      return;\n    }\n    if(mode === 'br'){ boxFromWidth(b.x, b.y, b.w + dx, 'br'); }\n    else if(mode === 'tl'){ boxFromWidth(b.x + b.w, b.y + b.h, b.w - dx, 'tl'); }\n    else if(mode === 'tr'){ boxFromWidth(b.x, b.y + b.h, b.w + dx, 'tr'); }\n    else if(mode === 'bl'){ boxFromWidth(b.x + b.w, b.y, b.w - dx, 'bl'); }\n    else if(mode === 'right'){ boxFromWidth(b.x, b.y + (b.h - (b.w + dx) / ratio) / 2, b.w + dx, 'right'); }\n    else if(mode === 'left'){ boxFromWidth(b.x + b.w, b.y + (b.h - (b.w - dx) / ratio) / 2, b.w - dx, 'left'); }\n    else if(mode === 'bottom'){ boxFromWidth(b.x + (b.w - (b.h + dy) * ratio) / 2, b.y, (b.h + dy) * ratio, 'bottom'); }\n    else if(mode === 'top'){ boxFromWidth(b.x + (b.w - (b.h - dy) * ratio) / 2, b.y + b.h, (b.h - dy) * ratio, 'top'); }\n    paint();\n  }\n\n  function endDrag(){\n    if(!mode) return;\n    mode = null;\n    dragStart = null;\n    crop.classList.remove('dragging');\n  }\n\n  crop.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(ev){\n    if(ev.target && ev.target.classList && ev.target.classList.contains('handle')) return;\n    beginDrag(ev, 'move');\n  });\n  [].slice.call(crop.querySelectorAll('.handle')).forEach(function(h){\n    h.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(ev){\n      ev.stopPropagation();\n      beginDrag(ev, h.getAttribute('data-h'));\n    });\n  });\n  crop.addEventListener('pointermove', function(ev){ moveDrag(ev.clientX, ev.clientY); });\n  crop.addEventListener('pointerup', endDrag);\n  crop.addEventListener('pointercancel', endDrag);\n\n  ratioBtns.forEach(function(b){\n    b.addEventListener('click', function(){\n      setRatio(parseFloat(b.getAttribute('data-ratio')), b.textContent.trim());\n    });\n  });\n\n  cancelBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){ reset(); });\n  applyBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    crop.style.transition = 'none';\n    crop.style.borderColor = 'var(--ui-success)';\n    crop.style.boxShadow = '0 0 0 2000px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 55%,transparent),0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-success) 45%,transparent)';\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      crop.style.borderColor = '';\n      crop.style.boxShadow = '';\n      crop.style.transition = '';\n    }, 1000);\n  });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function clickEl(c, el, done){\n    if(!el){ if(done) done(); return; }\n    c.moveTo(el);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      el.classList.add('pressing');\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.release();\n        el.classList.remove('pressing');\n        done();\n      }, 170);\n    }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function dragBy(c, dx, dy, dur, done){\n    var s = stageSize();\n    var sr = stage.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var cx = sr.left + s.w / 2, cy = sr.top + s.h / 2;\n    c.at(cx, cy);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      crop.classList.add('dragging');\n      mode = 'move';\n      dragStart = { px: cx, py: cy, box: { x: box.x, y: box.y, w: box.w, h: box.h } };\n      var t0 = performance.now();\n      function step(now){\n        var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / dur);\n        var e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);\n        moveDrag(dragStart.px + dx * e, dragStart.py + dy * e);\n        var gr = crop.getBoundingClientRect();\n        c.at(gr.left + gr.width / 2, gr.top + gr.height / 2);\n        if(t < 1){ rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step); }\n        else { mode = null; dragStart = null; crop.classList.remove('dragging'); c.release(); if(done) done(); }\n      }\n      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function resizeBy(c, dx, dy, dur, done){\n    var br = crop.querySelector('.handle.br');\n    var gr0 = br.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var px = gr0.left + gr0.width / 2, py = gr0.top + gr0.height / 2;\n    c.at(px, py);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      crop.classList.add('dragging');\n      mode = 'br';\n      dragStart = { px: px, py: py, box: { x: box.x, y: box.y, w: box.w, h: box.h } };\n      var t0 = performance.now();\n      function step(now){\n        var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / dur);\n        var e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);\n        moveDrag(dragStart.px + dx * e, dragStart.py + dy * e);\n        var gr = br.getBoundingClientRect();\n        c.at(gr.left + gr.width / 2, gr.top + gr.height / 2);\n        if(t < 1){ rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step); }\n        else { mode = null; dragStart = null; crop.classList.remove('dragging'); c.release(); if(done) done(); }\n      }\n      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    setRatio(1, '1:1');\n    reset();\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c) return;\n    if(c.el) c.el.classList.add('show');\n\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      clickEl(c, ratioBtns[1], function(){\n        setRatio(1.7778, '16:9');\n        setTimeout(function(){\n          dragBy(c, 14, 6, 560, function(){\n            setTimeout(function(){\n              resizeBy(c, 30, 18, 560, function(){\n                setTimeout(function(){\n                  clickEl(c, applyBtn, function(){\n                    setTimeout(function(){\n                      if(typeof c.hide === 'function') c.hide();\n                      setTimeout(function(){ setRatio(1, '1:1'); reset(); }, 1300);\n                    }, 500);\n                  });\n                }, 400);\n              });\n            }, 300);\n          });\n        }, 500);\n      });\n    }, 500);\n  }\n\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 8200); }, 300);\n  }\n\n  reset();\n  window.addEventListener('resize', function(){ paintPreview(); });\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){ setRatio(1, '1:1'); reset(); }\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
